  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>In the centre of mass frame, the total linear momentum of the&nbsp; system is zero.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
